          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP 493&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fox Creek&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N 54 28.992 W 116 58.252 Elev = 790&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When I was driving down to get this cap I was reminiscing about a 26 well project we did out here years ago. We used to hover over the highway and wait for traffic to thin out so we wouldn`t freak anyone out

when we zoomed in and landed the chopper between the east/west portions. Unfortunately the cap you chose was about 3 km from the one I used to use every day so I cannot really tell you that story   &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Honest&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTBCP Email already sent to CO &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks OFTH&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
